ich proves the plants reach the fields and the head's difference is the PR's; the three fields NOT among the eight (action plan `title`, evidence `source`, plan `phase`) accept the whole refused set at base AND head (no collateral); (b) the existing follow-up/answer note (`notes`, `answer.control-character`, 422; find its route by content at the head and in the neighbouring tests) and the customer name (`customer.name-invalid`, 400) refuse exactly the same partition of the same plants (212 of 212 refused, kept accepted; the STATUS differs by design: 400 here versus 422 for the answer note, a Note) so the new fields are measured against the existing behaviour on the SAME inputs; (c) **c-fail:** a literal edit of one of the eight checks (remove it) turns exactly that field's plants red in YOUR matrix; **cw-weak:** a copy of one plant test with its key assertion replaced by a statement that cannot fail reports GREEN while the real plant is RED under that edit. Print per field-route: plants sent, refused, accepted, the codes seen, stored-state unchanged y/n, and any scalar that disagrees with the oracle BY NAME (code point and position).

